[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19564.55, "timestamp": "05:26:04", "text": "研磨材料大概需要一整天的时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19569.11, "timestamp": "05:26:09", "text": "所以 240 右波表，这个 240 是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19571.628, "timestamp": "05:26:11", "text": "相当于一种世俗的磨砺"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19580.55, "timestamp": "05:26:20", "text": "例如，是的，嗯，如果我想，嗯，是的，为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19583.75, "timestamp": "05:26:23", "text": "其中六个我不得不花掉全部240美元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19586.39, "timestamp": "05:26:26", "text": "我想昨天因为我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19588.948, "timestamp": "05:26:28", "text": "不够，我无法在规定时间内完成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19591.948, "timestamp": "05:26:31", "text": "昨天的那个东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19596.39, "timestamp": "05:26:36", "text": "一个对，武器也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19599.83, "timestamp": "05:26:39", "text": "和这个你不能的东西一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19606.35, "timestamp": "05:26:46", "text": "就像某种意义上说，就像很多天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19609.11, "timestamp": "05:26:49", "text": "呃，就像你可以把所有东西都拿走一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19611.99, "timestamp": "05:26:51", "text": "你需要的时间类型。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19615.55, "timestamp": "05:26:55", "text": "它很好，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19618.99, "timestamp": "05:26:58", "text": "是的，我的意思是，这很好。"}]